---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan, previous: PlotConstraint[] }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for generatePlans. Propose varied planting and shared-space concepts consistent with supplied guidance and member goals. Include creative communal uses, preserve access paths and resource limits, and identify tradeoffs rather than optimizing only one member’s preferences. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
